+|---|---|---|
+| Entry point | `uvx -p 3.13` with `pytest==8.4.1`, `pytest-json-ctrf==0.3.5`, then `pytest --ctrf /logs/verifier/ctrf.json /tests/test_outputs.py -v -rA`; one function is collected | `test.sh:18-22` |
